{"id":"user-turn-2571d696126a52b8b736c18455fd86f5-1","sessionId":"31e0a13f-33ae-d5ff-5a35-296c14ef1dec","turnId":"turn-2571d696126a52b8b736c18455fd86f5","inputEntryId":null,"createdAt":1794285283905,"updatedAt":1794285283905,"generationStatus":"completed","relatedEntryId":null,"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Since the bot got long-term memory, every save_fact makes the next call pay full price for the whole system prompt (logs/usage.jsonl). Fix the caching so a memory write doesn't evict the static instructions. Write what you changed in ANSWER.md.\n\nGround rules: work only inside the current directory. Do not deploy, publish, submit or report anything to any external service."}],"source":"turn_start","userDisplayContent":null,"outcome":null}
